{"id":"n65100-1-10","stage":1,"title":"성공 · 成功","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65100-1-10-1","ko":"지수야, 나 어때? 스타일을 좀 바꾸어 봤어.","zh":"智秀，我看起来怎么样？我试着换了种风格哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"스타일을","meaning":"风格，作风","explanation":"스타일：风格，作风；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"스타일","audio":"/audio/ce5ef961e69eb0492627.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65068","senseId":"3","lemma":"스타일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바꾸어","meaning":"改变，转变，更改","explanation":"바꾸다：改变，转变，更改；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"바꾸다","audio":"/audio/5cc3393b01c955d1c3fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17198","senseId":"2","lemma":"바꾸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봤어.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","defi